// 003.13, 005.11 (T07): supporting + contrary evidence produces `Conflicted`; a void
// `Finding` leaves `Conflicted` unchanged; a valid `Finding ... Resolves ... Standard ...`
// resolves `Conflicted` to `Established` and unlocks dependent institutional competence.
Fact custodian Identified by Cust1.
Fact accountant Identified by Acct1.
Fact court Identified by Judge1.
Fact account Identified by Acc1.
Fact party Identified by Alice.
Fact court-quorum Identified by court.
Evidenced Fact beneficial-owner Identified by account * party.
Fact payout-cleared Identified by account * party.

Act report-owner Actor custodian Related to account, party
  Holds when True
  Supports beneficial-owner(account, party).

Act dispute-owner Actor accountant Related to account, party
  Holds when True
  Rebuts beneficial-owner(account, party).

Finding adjudicate-owner Actor court Related to account, party
  Resolves beneficial-owner(account, party)
  Standard preponderance
  Holds when Conflicted(beneficial-owner(account, party))
  Valid when court-quorum(court).

Power release-payout Actor custodian Related to account, party
  Holds when beneficial-owner(account, party)
  Valid when beneficial-owner(account, party)
  Creates payout-cleared(account, party).

Scenario conflict-escalated-to-finding {
  report-owner(Cust1, Acc1, Alice).
  ?Established(beneficial-owner(Acc1, Alice)).
  dispute-owner(Acct1, Acc1, Alice).
  ?Conflicted(beneficial-owner(Acc1, Alice)).
  ?undetermined release-payout(Cust1, Acc1, Alice).
  ?!valid release-payout(Cust1, Acc1, Alice).
  // Void finding (no quorum) must NOT resolve the conflict:
  ?!valid adjudicate-owner(Judge1, Acc1, Alice).
  adjudicate-owner(Judge1, Acc1, Alice).
  ?Conflicted(beneficial-owner(Acc1, Alice)).
  // Quorum established -> valid Finding resolves under `preponderance`:
  +court-quorum(Judge1).
  ?valid adjudicate-owner(Judge1, Acc1, Alice).
  adjudicate-owner(Judge1, Acc1, Alice).
  ?Established(beneficial-owner(Acc1, Alice)).
  ?!undetermined release-payout(Cust1, Acc1, Alice).
  ?valid release-payout(Cust1, Acc1, Alice).
  release-payout(Cust1, Acc1, Alice).
  ?payout-cleared(Acc1, Alice).
}
